      "message": "I think if we do this, it\u0027s going to get confusing. I\u0027d like to get rid of the global state that we have everywhere so we don\u0027t have code like [this `init_tpm_seed`](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4511814/26/test/fpsensor_auth_crypto.cc#169). Can you try creating a context that is passed around like you mentioned in the other review?",
